{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-039",
    "title": "记忆洪流"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_252",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "陆照临继续道，“你们留下的记忆可以出来，愿意承认它们的人自己承认。谁也不能替天下人决定该记得什么。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "最后一盏引路灯照亮通道后，天门下方出现了一条真正的裂口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7122,
          "end": 7122
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "裂口不像门缝，更像天空被人从中间剖开。裂口边缘流动着白色火焰，火焰下方悬着无数姓名牌。姓名牌相互碰撞，发出细密的金属声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7124,
          "end": 7124
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临站在裂口前，金丹中的青色纹路不断扩张。每一次纹路靠近金丹中心，他便会失去一段记忆。可这一次，失去的不是过去，而是对某种情绪的理解。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7126,
          "end": 7126
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他看见顾长离疲惫地坐在石阶上，却无法理解为什么自己会担心她。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7128,
          "end": 7128
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你在看什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7130,
          "end": 7130
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我在确认自己还认识你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7132,
          "end": 7132
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还认识吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7134,
          "end": 7134
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“认识名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7136,
          "end": 7136
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就够了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7138,
          "end": 7138
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜站在裂口另一侧，手里的黑色蜡片已经融化。他看着天门内的灯群，脸色越来越沉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7140,
          "end": 7140
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟盟的改写台在里面。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7142,
          "end": 7142
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你见过？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7144,
          "end": 7144
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“祖辈留下的地图上见过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7146,
          "end": 7146
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻将无相铜镜对准裂口。镜面显示出门内三座石台，分别刻着玄霄宗、顾氏和归墟盟的印记。三座石台中央，是一张空白的白纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7148,
          "end": 7148
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“改写台。”慧闻说，“谁把名字写上去，谁就能决定记忆的归属。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7150,
          "end": 7150
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冷声道：“所以归墟盟主想拿到它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7152,
          "end": 7152
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗也想。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7154,
          "end": 7154
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处传来剑鸣。玄霄宗守门派与开门派暂时停战，灰袍修士带着两派弟子共同赶来。为首的开门长老眉心仍留着青色纹路，声音已经半人半灵。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7156,
          "end": 7156
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟开门，三方皆可进入。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7158,
          "end": 7158
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“进入之后呢？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7160,
          "end": 7160
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“由天门决定谁有资格留下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7162,
          "end": 7162
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向他：“他已经被门占了一半。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7164,
          "end": 7164
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老笑了：“占据也是一种归还。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7166,
          "end": 7166
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门长老厉声道：“闭嘴！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7168,
          "end": 7168
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两派弟子再次拔剑，却被灰袍修士抬手压住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7170,
          "end": 7170
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7172,
          "end": 7172
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向归墟盟方向。归墟盟主也带人抵达，手中没有武器，只有一卷空白盟约。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7174,
          "end": 7174
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三方都到了。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7176,
          "end": 7176
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你想签什么？”慧闻问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7178,
          "end": 7178
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是签，是重写。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7180,
          "end": 7180
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主走向裂口。最后一盏引路灯的火焰向他倾斜，照出他黑衣上缝着的数百个名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7182,
          "end": 7182
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这些名字曾经属于谁？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7184,
          "end": 7184
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“属于被删去的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7186,
          "end": 7186
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你把它们缝在自己身上？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7188,
          "end": 7188
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我需要让门相信我记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7190,
          "end": 7190
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得不代表拥有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7192,
          "end": 7192
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋从裂口另一侧走来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7218,
          "end": 7218
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她披着雪色斗篷，手里提着已经熄灭的第三盏灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7220,
          "end": 7220
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是一个曾经替你们点灯的人。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7222,
          "end": 7222
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老后退：“你不该活着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7224,
          "end": 7224
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我活着，所以你们的证词才有意义。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7226,
          "end": 7226
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋把第三盏灯放在改写台上。灯罩内没有火，却映出三年前雪原的景象：陆沉舟把灯交给她，顾氏经手人站在一旁，归墟盟旧使者正在撕毁姓名纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7228,
          "end": 7228
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三方同时看见自己的过去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7230,
          "end": 7230
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主脸色变得难看：“关掉它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7232,
          "end": 7232
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们不是想要改写权吗？”沈砚秋问，“先让门看见谁在改写。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7234,
          "end": 7234
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯自行亮起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7236,
          "end": 7236
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "改写台上的三列文字同时变清晰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7238,
          "end": 7238
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门：由宗门决定。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7240,
          "end": 7240
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门：由强者决定。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7242,
          "end": 7242
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "留白：由所有人承担。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7244,
          "end": 7244
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临的金丹剧烈震动。天门内传来陆沉舟的声音：“照临，不要站在台上。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7246,
          "end": 7246
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7248,
          "end": 7248
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“台上没有人能保持完整。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7250,
          "end": 7250
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "是陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-103",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7326,
          "end": 7326
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离脸色苍白，却没有躲开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7414,
          "end": 7414
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你疯了？”陆照临喝道。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7416,
          "end": 7416
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只要听一句。”她说，“听完就放手。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7418,
          "end": 7418
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "声音终于从镜中传出，沙哑、遥远，像隔着许多年风雪。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7420,
          "end": 7420
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“长离，别替顾家守门。门若要开，就让后来的人自己决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7422,
          "end": 7422
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离闭上眼，泪水落在镜面上。那道身影随即散去，铜镜出现一道裂纹，洪流也从她掌下退开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7424,
          "end": 7424
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她没有取回全部记忆，却取回了一个真正属于自己的选择。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7426,
          "end": 7426
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看着掌心的空白，终于明白第三道细线代表什么。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7428,
          "end": 7428
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是新的力量，而是允许遗忘。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7430,
          "end": 7430
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他抬头，对门内的陆沉舟说：“我不进去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7432,
          "end": 7432
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟神情微动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7434,
          "end": 7434
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“但我也不关门。”陆照临继续道，“你们留下的记忆可以出来，愿意承认它们的人自己承认。谁也不能替天下人决定该记得什么。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7436,
          "end": 7436
        }
      }
    ],
